                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "A solitary island in the South Sea occupied by the Oceanian Army. The North American Allied Forces assaulted the island, which was a strategic point on the sea route for the Oceanian Army. After annihilating the Oceanian forces stationed on the island, the North American forces attack the resistance organization with their momentum.",
                        "jpn": "オセアニア軍が占拠している南海の孤島。オセアニア軍にとって海路の要衝となっているその島を北米同盟軍が強襲した。島に駐留するオセアニア軍を殲滅した北米軍は、その勢いのままレジスタンス組織に襲いかかる。"
                    },
