                        "jpn": "第二話"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "It was the unknown AMAIM who saved Hinukan from the predicament of being attacked by the North American army.\r\nChinen Ibuki and all the Hinukans, equipped with supplies brought in by their pilot, Jin Misawa, face the battle against the North American army.",
                        "jpn": "北米軍の襲撃を受けたヒヌカンの窮地を救ったのは正体不明のAMAIMだった。\r\nそのパイロット、三澤ジンが運び込んだ補給物資で装備を調えた知念イブキたちヒヌカンの一同は北米軍との戦いに臨む。"
                    },
